hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"441.1","Yahya related to me from Malik, from Nafi, that Abdullah ibn Umar did not pray on the day of Fitr before the prayer or after it."
"441.2",""
"442.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from Salih ibn Khawwat that Sahl ibn Abi Hathma related to him that the form of the prayer of fear was that the imam stood with a group of his companions"
"442.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad from Salih ibn Khawwat that Sahl ibn Abi Hathma related to him that the form of the prayer of fear was that the imam stood with a group of his companions"
"443.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar"
"443.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar"
"444.1","And it was narrated to me from Malik, from Hisham ibn Urwah, from his father, that he used to pray on the Day of Fitr before the prayer in the Masjid."
"444.2",""
